@startuml RandomProviderNetworkCommit
!include ../style.puml

title Random Provider Network - COMMIT PHASE

package "Provider Network" {
    component "Provider A (Lead)" as ProviderA <<RandomProvider>>
    component "Provider B" as ProviderB <<RandomProvider>>
    component "Provider C" as ProviderC <<RandomProvider>>
}

package "Whisper Network" {
    component "Whisper Network" as WhisperNet
}

package "Blockchain" {
    component "Contract Instance" as ContractInstance <<IRandomContract>>
}

' COMMIT PHASE - Whisper Network Socialization
ProviderA -[#FF9900]-> WhisperNet : broadcast commitment
ProviderB -[#FF9900]-> WhisperNet : broadcast commitment
ProviderC -[#FF9900]-> WhisperNet : broadcast commitment

WhisperNet .[#FF9900].> ProviderA : **1. Receive all commitments**
WhisperNet .[#FF9900].> ProviderB : receive all commitments
WhisperNet .[#FF9900].> ProviderC : receive all commitments

' COMMIT PHASE - Single Provider Posts All (Lead Provider)
ProviderA -[#FF9900]-> ContractInstance : **2. commit(allCommitments)**\nBATCH POST all commitments

note right of WhisperNet
  **WHISPER SOCIALIZATION**
  
  1. Each provider broadcasts commitment
  2. All providers receive all commitments
  3. Lead provider aggregates ALL
  4. Only lead provider posts to chain
end note

note bottom of ContractInstance
  **BATCH COMMIT**
  
  Single transaction contains
  commitments from ALL providers.
  Gas-efficient batch posting.
end note

note left of ProviderA
  **Lead Provider**
  
  Elected to post batch
  commitment transaction
  containing all provider
  commitments
end note

@enduml